!!omap
  - id: F044
  - function: DisplayReservationsScreen
  - range:
      - 853
      - 873
  - args:
      - ReservationPtr ReservationList
  - return: void
  - requirement: !!omap
      - trigger: ''
      - action: ''
      - effect: ''
      - constraint: ''
  - code: "void DisplayReservationsScreen(ReservationPtr ReservationList)\n{\n  ScreenHeader(\"\
      \\t Reservations List\");\n\n  if (ReservationList == NULL)\n  {\n    printf(\"\
      \\nList is empty!\");\n  }\n  else\n  {\n    ReservationPtr current = ReservationList;\n\
      \    int i = 0;\n    while (current != NULL)\n    {\n      printf(\"\\n - Reservation
      [%d]:\", ++i);\n      DisplayReservationCard(current);\n      current = current->Next;\n\
      \    }\n  }\n  PauseProgram();\n}\n"
  - description: この関数は、予約リストを画面に表示し、リストが空の場合はその旨を通知し、リストが存在する場合は各予約の詳細を順に表示します。
